  "decorated": "<div class=\"hero block\" data-block-name=\"hero\" data-block-status=\"loaded\"><div class=\"hero-panel\"><div class=\"hero-text\"><h1 id=\"welcome-to-fort-street-high-school\">Welcome to Fort Street High School</h1><p>Since 1849, Fortians have been encouraged to be the makers of their own destiny - <em><strong>faber est suae quisque fortunae</strong>.</em> This motto underpins the values and expectations of the school.</p><p><a href=\"/about-us/why-choose-us\" title=\"Why Choose Us?\">Why Choose Us?</a></p></div><picture class=\"hero-media\">\n                <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"./media_1090340827bba78fb192dc13c34a6856e5f572ce2.png?width=2000&amp;format=webply&amp;optimize=medium\" media=\"(min-width: 600px)\">\n                <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"./media_1090340827bba78fb192dc13c34a6856e5f572ce2.png?width=750&amp;format=webply&amp;optimize=medium\">\n                <source type=\"image/png\" srcset=\"./media_1090340827bba78fb192dc13c34a6856e5f572ce2.png?width=2000&amp;format=png&amp;optimize=medium\" media=\"(min-width: 600px)\">\n                <img loading=\"eager\" alt=\"Fort Street High School\" src=\"./media_1090340827bba78fb192dc13c34a6856e5f572ce2.png?width=750&amp;format=png&amp;optimize=medium\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" fetchpriority=\"high\">\n              </picture></div></div>"
