 "cards": {
  "authored": "<div class=\"cards list\">\n    <div>\n      <div>\n        <picture>\n          <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"./media_15921b7945b11dd4a59101cb1885fc8cac09d242c.jpg?width=2000&#x26;format=webply&#x26;optimize=medium\" media=\"(min-width: 600px)\">\n          <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"./media_15921b7945b11dd4a59101cb1885fc8cac09d242c.jpg?width=750&#x26;format=webply&#x26;optimize=medium\">\n          <source type=\"image/jpeg\" srcset=\"./media_15921b7945b11dd4a59101cb1885fc8cac09d242c.jpg?width=2000&#x26;format=jpg&#x26;optimize=medium\" media=\"(min-width: 600px)\">\n          <img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"./media_15921b7945b11dd4a59101cb1885fc8cac09d242c.jpg?width=750&#x26;format=jpg&#x26;optimize=medium\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1540\">\n        </picture>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h3 id=\"our-vision-for-student-achievement\"><a href=\"/about-us/why-choose-us\">Our vision for student achievement</a></h3>\n        <p>Fort Street is proud to continue its co-educational traditions. We value the mix of young men and women learning together. We expect students to develop as model citizens and work towards developing individual and collaborative skills and attributes in each student.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <div>\n        <picture>\n          <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"./media_1c7045882edfbbe0b0c20b6d7e957235d3966e57e.jpg?width=2000&#x26;format=webply&#x26;optimize=medium\" media=\"(min-width: 600px)\">\n          <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"./media_1c7045882edfbbe0b0c20b6d7e957235d3966e57e.jpg?width=750&#x26;format=webply&#x26;optimize=medium\">\n          <source type=\"image/jpeg\" srcset=\"./media_1c7045882edfbbe0b0c20b6d7e957235d3966e57e.jpg?width=2000&#x26;format=jpg&#x26;optimize=medium\" media=\"(min-width: 600px)\">\n          <img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"./media_1c7045882edfbbe0b0c20b6d7e957235d3966e57e.jpg?width=750&#x26;format=jpg&#x26;optimize=medium\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\">\n        </picture>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h3 id=\"extensive-range-of-student-opportunities-and-activities\"><a href=\"/school-life/student-opportunities-and-activities\">Extensive range of student opportunities and activities</a></h3>\n        <p>At Fort Street High School, we offer a variety of programs in the classroom and across the school to help students build new skills, make friends and explore new interests.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <div>\n        <picture>\n          <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"./media_12c1f23d8785ff22d72d738948eff4e098aaddb4a.jpg?width=2000&#x26;format=webply&#x26;optimize=medium\" media=\"(min-width: 600px)\">\n          <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"./media_12c1f23d8785ff22d72d738948eff4e098aaddb4a.jpg?width=750&#x26;format=webply&#x26;optimize=medium\">\n          <source type=\"image/jpeg\" srcset=\"./media_12c1f23d8785ff22d72d738948eff4e098aaddb4a.jpg?width=2000&#x26;format=jpg&#x26;optimize=medium\" media=\"(min-width: 600px)\">\n          <img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"./media_12c1f23d8785ff22d72d738948eff4e098aaddb4a.jpg?width=750&#x26;format=jpg&#x26;optimize=medium\" width=\"500\" height=\"300\">\n        </picture>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h3 id=\"wellbeing-at-fort-street-is-for-all-students\"><a href=\"/learning-and-support/wellbeing\">Wellbeing at Fort Street is for all students</a></h3>\n        <p>A focus on wellbeing goes beyond the welfare needs of a few individual students and aims for all students to be healthy, happy, successful and productive individuals who are active and positive contributors to the school and society in which they live.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>",
  "decorated": "<div class=\"cards list block cards-3up\" data-block-name=\"cards\" data-block-status=\"loaded\"><ul class=\"cards-grid\"><li class=\"cards-card is-linked\"><div class=\"cards-card-image\"><picture>\n                <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"./media_15921b7945b11dd4a59101cb1885fc8cac09d242c.jpg?width=2000&amp;format=webply&amp;optimize=medium\" media=\"(min-width: 600px)\">\n                <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"./media_15921b7945b11dd4a59101cb1885fc8cac09d242c.jpg?width=750&amp;format=webply&amp;optimize=medium\">\n                <source type=\"image/jpeg\" srcset=\"./media_15921b7945b11dd4a59101cb1885fc8cac09d242c.jpg?width=2000&amp;format=jpg&amp;optimize=medium\" media=\"(min-width: 600px)\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"./media_15921b7945b11dd4a59101cb1885fc8cac09d242c.jpg?width=750&amp;format=jpg&amp;optimize=medium\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1540\">\n              </picture></div><div class=\"cards-card-body\"><h3 id=\"our-vision-for-student-achievement\" class=\"cards-card-title\"><a href=\"/about-us/why-choose-us\" class=\"cards-card-link\">Our vision for student achievement</a></h3><p>Fort Street is proud to continue its co-educational traditions. We value the mix of young men and women learning together. We expect students to develop as model citizens and work towards developing individual and collaborative skills and attributes in each student.</p><span class=\"cards-card-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"></path></svg></span></div></li><li class=\"cards-card is-linked\"><div class=\"cards-card-image\"><picture>\n                <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"./media_1c7045882edfbbe0b0c20b6d7e957235d3966e57e.jpg?width=2000&amp;format=webply&amp;optimize=medium\" media=\"(min-width: 600px)\">\n                <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"./media_1c7045882edfbbe0b0c20b6d7e957235d3966e57e.jpg?width=750&amp;format=webply&amp;optimize=medium\">\n                <source type=\"image/jpeg\" srcset=\"./media_1c7045882edfbbe0b0c20b6d7e957235d3966e57e.jpg?width=2000&amp;format=jpg&amp;optimize=medium\" media=\"(min-width: 600px)\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"./media_1c7045882edfbbe0b0c20b6d7e957235d3966e57e.jpg?width=750&amp;format=jpg&amp;optimize=medium\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\">\n              </picture></div><div class=\"cards-card-body\"><h3 id=\"extensive-range-of-student-opportunities-and-activities\" class=\"cards-card-title\"><a href=\"/school-life/student-opportunities-and-activities\" class=\"cards-card-link\">Extensive range of student opportunities and activities</a></h3><p>At Fort Street High School, we offer a variety of programs in the classroom and across the school to help students build new skills, make friends and explore new interests.</p><span class=\"cards-card-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"></path></svg></span></div></li><li class=\"cards-card is-linked\"><div class=\"cards-card-image\"><picture>\n                <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"./media_12c1f23d8785ff22d72d738948eff4e098aaddb4a.jpg?width=2000&amp;format=webply&amp;optimize=medium\" media=\"(min-width: 600px)\">\n                <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"./media_12c1f23d8785ff22d72d738948eff4e098aaddb4a.jpg?width=750&amp;format=webply&amp;optimize=medium\">\n                <source type=\"image/jpeg\" srcset=\"./media_12c1f23d8785ff22d72d738948eff4e098aaddb4a.jpg?width=2000&amp;format=jpg&amp;optimize=medium\" media=\"(min-width: 600px)\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"./media_12c1f23d8785ff22d72d738948eff4e098aaddb4a.jpg?width=750&amp;format=jpg&amp;optimize=medium\" width=\"500\" height=\"300\">\n              </picture></div><div class=\"cards-card-body\"><h3 id=\"wellbeing-at-fort-street-is-for-all-students\" class=\"cards-card-title\"><a href=\"/learning-and-support/wellbeing\" class=\"cards-card-link\">Wellbeing at Fort Street is for all students</a></h3><p>A focus on wellbeing goes beyond the welfare needs of a few individual students and aims for all students to be healthy, happy, successful and productive individuals who are active and positive contributors to the school and society in which they live.</p><span class=\"cards-card-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"></path></svg></span></div></li></ul></div>"
